        "quote": "(a) Prohibition. It shall be unlawful for any person to make any direct or indirect charge, or receive any gift, donation or subscription by any means whatsoever, for or in connection with the carrying on, practicing or professing to practice the business or art of astrology, palmistry, phrenology, fortunetelling, cartomancy, clairvoyance, clairaudience, crystal gazing, mediumship, prophecy, augury, seership, necromancy or other similar practice. The provisions of this section shall not apply to:",
